From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 09:24:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Distinguish compact capacity refusal and guard reconstruction
 lifecycle

Scan resource-refused compact frames without retaining over-quota objects, preflight prefills before slot copies, and prevent late same-BlockID responses from being confused with a second missing request. Exercise real ambiguity branches with a standalone test-only collision seam; production hashing remains fixed.
