 so this byte quota is not a claim of an equal resident-memory ceiling. Caller
 must also bound its existing cache, per-peer/global queues and retained codec
-objects. The decoder count checks use both available wire bytes and local caps;
+objects. Allocation failure (`std::bad_alloc`) is an operational exception for
