 are compiled directly from the inherited ABC crypto sources. Chronik is absent.
 The standalone suite checks full/compact identical bytes and BlockIDs, exact
 identities, witness variants, deterministic ambiguity policy, duplicate short-ID
 fallback, incremental envelope splits, malformed lengths/counts/deltas/trailing
 bytes, wrong network/identity, absent witnesses, response association, exact
